Description: correspondence client for mail, calendar and messaging sites
 corMani is a desktop correspondence client. It handles many mail accounts
 over IMAP and SMTP, with calendars alongside them, and tracks which
 conversations are owed a reply and which carry a deadline.
 .
 Messaging services that publish no interface for personal conversations
 appear as panels in the same window.
 .
 This package is for the author's own machine until stage 9 (hardening) has
 passed; it is not a release for other people.
